<title>POLAND: Boryszew plans 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>Boryszew plans 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish chemical company Boryszew SA plans to earmark 2.1 million zlotys of its 8.2-million-zloty 1996 net profit for dividend, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The management's proposal would be voted on the company's general shareholders meeting on June 16.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
